{
 "duration": 25.95,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Maya starts down the Bright Angel Trail.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.502
  },
  {
   "text": "Downhill feels easy, so she keeps going past the point she planned.",
   "start": 2.652,
   "end": 6.381
  },
  {
   "text": "Then she turns around, and the whole canyon is above her.",
   "start": 6.631,
   "end": 9.662
  },
  {
   "text": "At the Grand Canyon, the climb back out is the hard part.",
   "start": 9.912,
   "end": 13.241
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Pick your turnaround point at the rim, like the 1.5 Mile Resthouse,",
   "start": 13.591,
   "end": 19.21
  },
  {
   "text": "and turn there while you still feel fresh.",
   "start": 19.36,
   "end": 21.326
  },
  {
   "text": "Maya climbs out before dark, smiling.",
   "start": 21.676,
   "end": 23.761
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your canyon trip.",
   "start": 24.061,
   "end": 25.75
  }
 ],
